## Strings for the Warp Whistle add-on.
## Client-side translations live in the resource pack; the behavior pack
## references them by key with RawMessage { translate: ... }.

item.steveo:warp_whistle.name=Warp Whistle

warp_whistle.hint=Use: open the warp menu. Crouch + use: set a waypoint where you stand. Home is always your bed.

